<description>&lt;p&gt;The Colombian army faced a court sentencing five former soldiers to reparations work for executions, while a wave of deadly accidents struck the country, including a coal mine explosion that killed two and left two missing, a bus overturning in southwestern Colombia that killed eight and injured twenty, and a bus crash on a motorway that killed six after the driver fell asleep. Social leaders continue to be targeted, with more than 45 killed in the first 100 days of the current administration. A bomb hit a police patrol near a Carabineros school in Cali without causing injuries. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOQnAyWXczaWpFRWw0MVFrVUVCbWtEV1FmZGFzZ0VCT19EMzZXM1ZMZDVOMjJ2dFhMdGtNY3ExOGt3WlRMQ3BOMVkwOFAyQzdyV0NCdHgwR2I2aG8tY2tMX3NNOWlXZl80MEdTcmRWZDVrcHRjTFlDYzJhV2ZrdjQ2Q3RURUlXbTI0Z1RkSGVGaXp1b1ZnNHI2SEhDZk9FNnR5QV9SYnhjbEVlZTlhYm11b1hKQWJaTXBVaVdYckxB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNaXNsLTVsbnVYNlFBZ3pPTnJpZlpxVkc2bUU3MF8tc3JiTDhFTExDdmpkREpyVXNxUjlqaFpJYUprUkl0VklTWWNBZXVVdkZyZTZHWUE2Z3pSamhnTWRBVkxIcV9vOTItX3U5c1VaeDRFcGlhWWpBNjR0cE1sU2RMU0oxNGpNMXlVMllVY00wdmNtdmZISUFFa0V2dEVlN0RqekZKekMyNEFHeEVFMUZtclF2MGxaSkVXTFlkdA?oc=5&quot;&gt;teleSUR English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNRXBrYzRVVS1jUTNOS0xYSTF3anJPQmRfZ0tvT1lTOWlwZnczTDBaV084RUswdnNDNjd3TjhUZ3dwYVd6UnplZUk3TndPRGdYX21jalA3Y3UtOEFJb0xXSVRaNmRJS0R0Qm5tOURJNllkV3lvYk9NclROY2hZYjNQZmhjUTg3MDJNYmxhRkhlX0tjTHFUajFucEF1YU5TeGZjNDZMMVhxZmE0UkN6cTd0M1EtUzd5RW_SAbwBQVVfeXFMUF9HMWw3NVN0LXVDdmhqcC1oQzd6dkZ3VW5BM2ZGcVZ4RnRHZ1Z4M3FoVEEyS3RyTUQ0YW14NDMtc0lwMEZhZ3gzNTVqaF8xdVBOdzRONkR5c0kxbHQxM05QNXE0QV81X2E3bHRLdUFMM0paTkFZS1pGRVo